{"title":"Career Roadmap · Infrastructure Planner","role":"Infrastructure Planner","summary":"An Infrastructure Planner plans and coordinates the spatial, functional and long-term development of infrastructure systems such as:","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Plan (Bachelor of Planning)","Course":"Landscape / Transport / Infrastructure Planning"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Infrastructure Planner plans and coordinates the spatial, functional and long-term development of infrastructure systems such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Roads and highways"},{"text":"Public transport systems"},{"text":"Rail and metro corridors"},{"text":"Airports and logistics facilities"},{"text":"Water supply and wastewater systems"},{"text":"Stormwater and drainage"},{"text":"Solid-waste infrastructure"},{"text":"Energy and utility networks"},{"text":"Digital infrastructure"},{"text":"Industrial and logistics zones"},{"text":"Public facilities"},{"text":"Green and blue infrastructure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of urban planning, infrastructure systems, GIS, transport planning, land-use planning, environmental assessment and project coordination."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Career Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","Infrastructure Planning","GIS","Transport Planning","Land-Use Planning","Infrastructure Systems","Spatial Analysis","Data Analytics","Project Planning → Infrastructure Planner"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Plan","Planning Fundamentals","Urban + Regional Planning","Infrastructure Systems","Transport + Utilities + Public Facilities","GIS + Spatial Analysis","Infrastructure Demand + Capacity Analysis","Land-Use + Network Planning","Infrastructure Project Internship","Infrastructure Planning Analyst","Infrastructure Planner","Senior Infrastructure Planner","Infrastr